{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"亲近和确信仍然在，但原先只是贴身牵住的不满足，现在变得更主动、更迫切：人更深地投入其中，也更明显地想从这份已经真实的满足里得到更多。\",\"thread\":\"前面已经知道，这里确实能给自己想要的东西，却又不足以真正安顿需要。因此此刻不必退回怀疑，也很难满足于已经得到的部分：正因为已有的满足可信，尚未得到的那一部分才有了更具体的分量，使投入加深，也使索求变得迫切。\",\"used\":\"依赖第2段已经获得的真实满足，以及第3段第一次分清“它确实能给我东西”和“这些还不足以让我安顿下来”。\",\"new\":[\"原先只是隐约存在的不足，现在已经足以改变人的投入方式：不是离开已有的满足，而是在相信它的同时向其中要求更多。\",\"越确信已有的满足是真的，尚未被满足的部分就越难再被当作无关紧要的余留。\"],\"unexplained\":\"无\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fec99b30-45a0-479a-8c45-a9fcd0df5508", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T220028162756Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.234, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:00:55.407245+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "056bfc2c4148cd2115d42ea48eeeb1e9813a3d247eeec23a334f9d728d40cf20", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee53